              digital experiences, and visuals people remember.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" href="#work">
                Explore our work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
              <a class="button button-quiet" href="#about">
                Get to know us <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-footnote">
              <span class="hero-footnote-line"></span>
              <span>STRATEGY. DESIGN. IMPACT.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Abstract creative composition">
            <div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div>
            <div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div>
            <div class="art-glow"></div>
            <div class="art-square art-square-back"></div>
            <div class="art-square art-square-front">
              <div class="art-letter">E<span>.</span></div>
              <div class="art-square-caption">MAKE IT<br />MATTER.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="art-chip chip-top">CREATIVE / 001</div>
            <div class="art-chip chip-bottom">EST. FOR WHAT'S NEXT ↗</div>
            <div class="art-spark spark-one">✳</div>
            <div class="art-spark spark-two">✳</div>
            <div class="art-coordinate">06° 27' N<br />03° 24' E</div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-bottom">
            <span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span>
            <span class="scroll-line"></span>
            <span>01 / 06</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ABOUT -->
        <section class="about section-wrap section-spacing" id="about">
          <div class="section-kicker">
            <span>01 — THE STUDIO</span>
            <span>GOOD DESIGN IS NEVER AN ACCIDENT.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="about-grid">
            <h2 class="section-heading">
              We make brands<br />
              <span class="muted-heading">impossible to ignore.</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="about-copy">
              <p class="large-copy">
                Emirate Studios is a creative studio for brands ready to
                stand apart.
              </p>
              <p class="body-copy">
                We combine strategic thinking with expressive design to make
                meaningful work. From the first idea to the final detail,
                every decision has a purpose — and every project gets the
                attention it deserves.
              </p>
              <a class="text-link" href="#services">
                What we bring to the table <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

